[en.DOCTRINE_AIR_0_0_OPEN_SKY]
Open Sky

[en.DOCTRINE_AIR_0_0_OPEN_SKY_DESC]
The sky belongs only to birds and pegasi, while most creatures still live on the ground. Let those arrogant fliers fall, and our sky will remain clean.

[en.DOCTRINE_AIR_0_0_OPEN_SKY_desc]


[zh.DOCTRINE_AIR_0_0_OPEN_SKY]
开放天空

[zh.DOCTRINE_AIR_0_0_OPEN_SKY_DESC]
天空只属于鸟儿与飞马，多数的生物依然依靠大地生存。让那些自大的飞行者坠落吧，我们的天空将保持清洁。

[zh.DOCTRINE_AIR_0_0_OPEN_SKY_desc]
